== 3. the signature: only cut-release.yml, in Actions, can produce it ==
No signed tag exists for: policy/v5.0.0
Where evidence is already written, the gate has run and the array element is correct,
and only the signature is outstanding. Where step 2 printed '..' for a tag, the gate
